			"notes": "# In this version\n## New Features\n- Added wall variants for the following blocks:\n  - Runestone\n  - Polished Runestone\n  - Runestone Bricks\n  - Squared Runestone Bricks\n  - Patterned Runestone\n  - Polished Dripstone\n  - Dripstone Bricks\n  - Stone Quartz\n  - Stone Quartz Bricks\n## Changes\n- Slight recipe tweaks\n- Recipes might unlock when you get the required blocks\n  - The vanilla system for this is... not great, so I'd recommend you install EMI or JEI to have access to the recipes more easily. Otherwise, good luck figuring out the recipes.\n## Technical Changes\n- Moved many files to data-generated system\n  - This won't be noticeable when playing, but it makes development much easier."
