			"notes": "Initial release of Dungeonified\n\n# In this version\n## New features\n- 18 new blocks\n  - Runestone, crafted with 2 Stone and 2 Tuff\n  - Stone Quartz, crafted with 2 Stone and 2 Quartz\n  - Dripstone Polished and Brick variants\n  - Burnt pumpkin, obtained by cooking a pumpkin in a furnace\n- Variants for most of these blocks, with pretty self explanatory recipes\n  - These recipes will be added to the recipe book in a future update\n- Textures from Minecraft Dungeons for many vanilla mobs\n  - Variants like the wooly cow or frozen zombie aren't implemented yet\n\nA note on block names: Due to the nature of Minecraft Dungeons assets, I had to make up names for these blocks. I know they're not great, please let me know if you come up with a better name for blocks."
